9. **@ManyToMany**: Defines a many-to-many relationship.

```java
import javax.persistence.Entity;
import javax.persistence.Id;
import javax.persistence.ManyToMany;
import java.util.Set;

@Entity
public class User {
    @Id
    private Long id;

