To implement code syntax highlighting in a React application similar to what you see in ChatGPT, you can use libraries such as `react-syntax-highlighter` or `Prism.js`. These libraries provide syntax highlighting for code blocks in various programming languages.

Here’s how you can set up `react-syntax-highlighter`:

